  "task": "We're launching a new gaming headset next month and need to execute an influencer campaign. Help me: find gaming influencers on Twitch and Twitter with loyal audiences, finalize and distribute the campaign brief to selected creators, monitor real-time sentiment around the product launch, and escalate any emerging hardware defect controversies with evidence preservation."
